capes.json.gz: the named capes and points of OpenStreetMap (natural=cape, and the localities and points
named as capes), with their positions and whether they have a Wikidata entry; coves.json.gz: the named
bays and coves of OpenStreetMap (natural=bay, water=cove), the same way. Both as built by
`cargo xtask capes` from `scripts/fetch-osm-capes.sh`.

